  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/TPWMJpYb/Image-2.png\" width=\"645\" height=\"177\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aCVrHKeDH6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1206208925590884352.svg?label=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=7289DA&amp;style=flat\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你覺得把<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>點燃的</strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>熔爐</strong> </span>放在<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>易燃方塊</strong></span>旁邊現實嗎？我不這麼認為... 讓我們改變這一切！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/T3svbrGG/Image-3.png\" width=\"394\" height=\"89\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/dW9xROm.gif\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>熔爐方塊</strong></span>現在會在點燃時，若附近有易燃方塊，則觸發<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>火焰蔓延</strong></span>效果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預設情況下，每隔<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>5秒</strong></span>檢查一次<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>2格半徑</strong></span>內的方塊，從熔爐方塊開始引發火災。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr style=\"border:2px solid #ff0000\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>嗨！喜歡這個模組嗎？我還有其他幾個你可能會喜歡的。😊</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-interaction-disabler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/JhMz01hW/Icon-7.gif\" alt=\"物品互動禁用模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/burning-furnace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/vZ6VfHMg/Icon-2.gif\" alt=\"燃燒熔爐模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brew-chew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PJrDwWrT/Icon-1.gif\" alt=\"釀造咀嚼模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/qv87pt4L/Icon-6.gif\" alt=\"額外血腥模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lit-it-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/9MfXPJT8/Icon-8.gif\" alt=\"點亮它模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-mo-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YqFrx4GH/Icon-10.gif\" alt=\"不再有傳送門模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miner-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PxFXSYQt/Icon-9.gif\" alt=\"礦工村民模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experimental-settings-disabler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Fz7RvDHd/Icon-4.gif\" alt=\"實驗性設定禁用模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-color-codes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/gkLJBS71/Icon-5.gif\" alt=\"額外顏色代碼模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>",
